Task #138: Fix plan/build session survival on navigation

- Increased done session retention from 5 min to 30 min
- Added doneAt timestamp to ManagerChatSession, pruning now uses
  doneAt instead of startedAt for accurate post-completion retention
- Added lastPlan and lastBuildResult columns to projects table
- Server persists plan on plan_ready and build result on all_complete
- Added GET /api/projects/:id/plan and /build-result endpoints
- Added isMgrReconnecting state (useState + ref) for manager reconnect
  status tracking; isManagerResponding only set true for active streams,
  not done sessions during status probing
- restorePlanFromDB: checks localStorage/managerMessages first, then
  falls back to DB endpoint; populates taskStatuses for each step
- ide-store loadProject: falls back to saved.managerPlan when no plan
  found in managerMessages
- restoreBuildResultFromDB: fetches from DB when build session pruned,
  restores build result with summary, sets task statuses to done
- Build completion triggers file sync only when user is still on
  the same project (prevents navigation hijack)
- Replaced any casts with proper ManagerPlan/ManagerMessage types
- Omitted lastPlan/lastBuildResult from insertProjectSchema
